Pick several apps at once, and keep DuraSpeed off

• The app picker now has checkboxes and opens with your current list ticked — building a list of ten apps no longer means ten trips through the menu.
• New setting: keep MediaTek's DuraSpeed off. It stops background apps, including this service, which is why keys silently stop working on some devices. It is watched, not just switched once.
• Fixes to app names in the picker and to the DuraSpeed watcher.
